# CODEOWNERS: automatic review assignment
#
# This file tells GitHub which users or teams should be automatically requested
# for review when a pull request modifies files they own. Without any active
# rules below, no automatic review assignment happens.
#
# To activate, uncomment one of the patterns below (or add your own) and replace
# the placeholder usernames with the GitHub usernames of the maintainers.
#
# Example:
#   *               @alice @bob          # every PR needs alice and bob
#   /docs/          @carol               # docs changes need carol
#   *.go            @dave                # Go changes need dave
#
# See https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

